sequenceDiagram
  actor Wr as Writer
  participant C as AiController
  participant S as AiScriptService
  participant G as AiGateway
  participant L as AiRequestLogService
  participant A as AI service
  participant M as LLM API
  Wr->>C: POST /ai/script/generate (topic, subject, grade)
  C->>S: generateScript(req)
  S->>G: generateScript(req), remote mode
  G->>L: start(type, model)
  G->>A: POST /script/generate (service key)
  A->>M: Structured prompt
  M-->>A: JSON
  A->>A: Validate against schema
  A-->>G: Result, model, usage
  G->>L: complete(id, usage), cost from AI_PRICING_JSON
  S-->>C: AiActionResponse(requestId)
  C-->>Wr: Suggestion shown
  Wr->>C: PUT /ai/requests/{id}/decision
  C->>L: decide(ACCEPTED or IGNORED)
